    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11939" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπερί-πτωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
